ather and save its token. Then use the one-time code in the recipient confirmation section below, or enter your chat ID manually.'=>'Create a bot with @BotFather and save its token. Then use the one-time code in the recipient confirmation section below, or enter your chat ID manually.','Chat ID'=>'Chat ID','Private chats: numeric ID. Groups: often a negative ID. Public channels: @channelname; the bot needs permission to post.'=>'Private chats: numeric ID. Groups: often a negative ID. Public channels: @channelname; the bot needs permission to post.','Automatic discovery is intended for a new bot that has received a private message. It does not change an existing webhook and cannot work while a webhook is active.'=>'Automatic discovery is intended for a new bot that has received a private message. It does not change an existing webhook and cannot work while a webhook is active.','WhatsApp requires a configured WhatsApp Business account, a Cloud API phone number, a suitable access token, and a message template approved by Meta. An API key alone is not enough. Charges may apply according to Meta\'s pricing.'=>'WhatsApp requires a configured WhatsApp Business account, a Cloud API phone number, a suitable access token, and a message template approved by Meta. An API key alone is not enough. Charges may apply according to Meta\'s pricing.','Phone Number ID'=>'Phone Number ID','The numeric ID of the sending WhatsApp Business phone number in Meta, not the phone number itself.'=>'The numeric ID of the sending WhatsApp Business phone number in Meta, not the phone number itself.','Recipient phone number'=>'Recipient phone number','Phone number in international format, e.g. 491701234567. The recipient must have agreed to receive your WhatsApp messages.'=>'Phone number in international format, e.g. 491701234567. The recipient must have agreed to receive your WhatsApp messages.','Approved full-content template name'=>'Approved full-content template name','Used when extended privacy is off. The approved template requires five body text parameters. Lowercase letters, digits, and underscores only.'=>'Used when extended privacy is off. The approved template requires five body text parameters. Lowercase letters, digits, and underscores only.','Approved extended-privacy template name'=>'Approved extended-privacy template name','Required when extended privacy is on. Use a separately approved body-only template with exactly two positional text parameters: {{1}} website name and {{2}} protected administrator URL. No variable headers or buttons.'=>'Required when extended privacy is on. Use a separately approved body-only template with exactly two positional text parameters: {{1}} website name and {{2}} protected administrator URL. No variable headers or buttons.','Template language'=>'Template language','The exact language code of the approved template, e.g. de or en_US.'=>'The exact language code of the approved template, e.g. de or en_US.','Graph API version'=>'Graph API version','Version in the format v24.0. Use a version supported by Meta.'=>'Version in the format v24.0. Use a version supported by Meta.','Set up your full-content WhatsApp template'=>'Set up your full-content WhatsApp template','Keep exactly five positional body text parameters: name, email address, subject, all labelled form answers, website. Do not use variable headers or buttons. All labels and answers together are limited to 500 characters; the five parameter values to 900. Use at most 124 characters of fixed template text. Missing name or email is shown as a dash.'=>'Keep exactly five positional body text parameters: name, email address, subject, all labelled form answers, website. Do not use variable headers or buttons. All labels and answers together are limited to 500 characters; the five parameter values to 900. Use at most 124 characters of fixed template text. Missing name or email is shown as a dash.','New contact inquiry
Name: {{1}}
Email: {{2}}
Subject: {{3}}
Details: {{4}}
Website: {{5}}'=>'New contact inquiry
Name: {{1}}
Email: {{2}}
Subject: {{3}}
Details: {{4}}
Website: {{5}}','This example shows the required structure. Meta reviews the content, category, and intended use; approval is not guaranteed. Provide suitable sample values for all five variables when applying.'=>'This example shows the required structure. Meta reviews the content, category, and intended use; approval is not guaranteed. Provide suitable sample values for all five variables when applying.','Set up your extended-privacy WhatsApp template'=>'Set up your extended-privacy WhatsApp template','Create and submit a separate template in WhatsApp Manager. Keep exactly two positional body text parameters in this order: website name, protected administrator URL. The existing five-parameter template cannot be used for extended privacy. Meta decides whether to approve the template.'=>'Create and submit a separate template in WhatsApp Manager. Keep exactly two positional body text parameters in this order: website name, protected administrator URL. The existing five-parameter template cannot be used for extended privacy. Meta decides whether to approve the template.','New inquiry on {{1}}. Open securely: {{2}}'=>'New inquiry on {{1}}. Open securely: {{2}}','Privacy & retention'=>'Privacy & retention','Explain the enabled delivery channels and local storage in your privacy policy. Channels with extended privacy receive only the website name and a protected administrator link; channels without it receive the form answers. Original inquiries for extended privacy are stored encrypted on this website. Hosting, email and messaging services may keep their own data.'=>'Explain the enabled delivery channels and local storage in your privacy policy. Channels with extended privacy receive only the website name and a protected administrator link; channels without it receive the form answers. Original inquiries for extended privacy are stored encrypted on this website. Hosting, email and messaging services may keep their own data.','Keep locally stored inquiries for this many days'=>'Keep locally stored inquiries for this many days','Default: 30 days. Set 0 to keep inquiries indefinitely until you delete them. Values from 1 to 36500 set the retention period in whole days.'=>'Default: 30 days. Set 0 to keep inquiries indefinitely until you delete them. Values from 1 to 36500 set the retention period in whole days.','Changes apply only to new inquiries. Existing inquiries keep their saved expiry date; delete them separately in Inquiries.'=>'Changes apply only to new inquiries. Existing inquiries keep their saved expiry date; delete them separately in Inquiries.','Open inquiries'=>'Open inquiries','Delete settings and stored credentials when the plugin is deleted'=>'Delete settings and stored credentials when the plugin is deleted','Stored inquiries and runtime data are always removed when the plugin is deleted, regardless of this setting. Deactivation does not delete settings or inquiries. Remove wp-config.php values and messages held by external services separately.'=>'Stored inquiries and runtime data are always removed when the plugin is deleted, regardless of this setting. Deactivation does not delete settings or inquiries. Remove wp-config.php values and messages held by external services separately.','Save settings'=>'Save settings','All changes saved'=>'All changes saved','Enable the channel you want to use and save your settings first. Tests send sample data to the selected service and configured recipient. Chat ID discovery uses the stored Telegram token.'=>'Enable the channel you want to use and save your settings first. Tests send sample data to the selected service and configured recipient. Chat ID discovery uses the stored Telegram token.','Test %s'=>'Test %s','Confirm your Telegram recipient'=>'Confirm your Telegram recipient','Send this one-time code to your bot in a private Telegram chat, then confirm below. The code expires after 10 minutes. Only share it with your intended recipient.'=>'Send this one-time code to your bot in a private Telegram chat, then confirm below. The code expires after 10 minutes. Only share it with your intended recipient.','Confirm Telegram recipient'=>'Confirm Telegram recipient','Save a valid Telegram bot token first to generate a pairing code. You can also enter the chat ID manually.'=>'Save a valid Telegram bot token first to generate a pairing code. You can also enter the chat ID manually.','Signal is not integrated because it has no comparable official bot API. This plugin uses the official Cloud API for WhatsApp and the Bot API for Telegram.'=>'Signal is not integrated because it has no comparable official bot API. This plugin uses the official Cloud API for WhatsApp and the Bot API for Telegram.','Telegram setup'=>'Telegram setup','WhatsApp setup with Meta'=>'WhatsApp setup with Meta','The form has expired. Please reload the page and try again.'=>'The form has expired. Please reload the page and try again.','The message could not be accepted.'=>'The message could not be accepted.','Please wait a moment and submit again.'=>'Please wait a moment and submit again.','Please reload the page.'=>'Please reload the page.','Please confirm the privacy notice.'=>'Please confirm the privacy notice.','The contact form has not been set up yet. Please use another way to get in touch.'=>'The contact form has not been set up yet. Please use another way to get in touch.','A request is already being processed. Please wait a moment.'=>'A request is already being processed. Please wait a moment.','Too many requests. Please try again in ten minutes.'=>'Too many requests. Please try again in ten minutes.','This message is already being processed. Please wait a moment.'=>'This message is already being processed. Please wait a moment.','The inquiry could not be stored securely. Please try again later or use another way to get in touch.'=>'The inquiry could not be stored securely. Please try again later or use another way to get in touch.','The inquiry could not be stored securely. No notification was sent.'=>'The inquiry could not be stored securely. No notification was sent.','The notification could not be sent. Please check the delivery settings.'=>'The notification could not be sent. Please check the delivery settings.','The message could not be passed to a delivery service right now. Please try again later or use another way to get in touch.'=>'The message could not be passed to a delivery service right now. Please try again later or use another way to get in touch.','Please complete the setup for this channel.'=>'Please complete the setup for this channel.','New inquiry via the contact form on %s.'=>'New inquiry via the contact form on %s.','Name: '=>'Name: ','Email: '=>'Email: ','Subject: '=>'Subject: ','New contact inquiry'=>'New contact inquiry','The service could not be reached. Please check the server connection and service status.'=>'The service could not be reached. Please check the server connection and service status.','The service did not confirm the request. Please check the token and recipient, and for WhatsApp, the template, language, and account status.'=>'The service did not confirm the request. Please check the token and recipient, and for WhatsApp, the template, language, and account status.','Please enable the delivery channel and save your settings first.'=>'Please enable the delivery channel and save your settings first.','Plugin test'=>'Plugin test','ContactBridge – Test'=>'ContactBridge – Test','The connection works. This is a test message from the WordPress settings.'=>'The connection works. This is a test message from the WordPress settings.','Settings'=>'Settings','Our contact form processes the fields configured by the site operator, such as name, email, phone number, subject, message and selected options. For each enabled channel, the operator chooses full-content delivery or extended privacy. Full-content channels send the submitted details by email, Telegram or the WhatsApp Business Platform. Extended-privacy channels receive only a general notification, the website name and a link requiring an authorized WordPress administrator login; no submitted fields or visitor reply address are included.'=>'Our contact form processes the fields configured by the site operator, such as name, email, phone number, subject, message and selected options. For each enabled channel, the operator chooses full-content delivery or extended privacy. Full-content channels send the submitted details by email, Telegram or the WhatsApp Business Platform. Extended-privacy channels receive only a general notification, the website name and a link requiring an authorized WordPress administrator login; no submitted fields or visitor reply address are included.','When extended privacy is enabled for an active channel, the inquiry is stored encrypted in this website\'s WordPress database. Administrators can read and delete it. The default retention is 30 days; the operator can choose another period or permanent storage. Each inquiry retains the period selected when it was received. Expired inquiries are hidden and automatically deleted through scheduled cleanup; backups may retain separate copies. If all channels use full-content delivery, the plugin does not create a local inquiry archive.'=>'When extended privacy is enabled for an active channel, the inquiry is stored encrypted in this website\'s WordPress database. Administrators can read and delete it. The default retention is 30 days; the operator can choose another period or permanent storage. Each inquiry retains the period selected when it was received. Expired inquiries are hidden and automatically deleted through scheduled cleanup; backups may retain separate copies. If all channels use full-content delivery, the plugin does not create a local inquiry archive.','To prevent abuse, the plugin temporarily stores keyed identifiers and delivery status without message content. The server processes the IP address but the plugin does not store it in plain text. The plugin adds no tracking cookies, remote fonts, advertising or analytics. Specify the actual recipients, purposes, legal bases, retention periods and any international transfers applicable to your website; enabling extended privacy does not by itself guarantee GDPR compliance.'=>'To prevent abuse, the plugin temporarily stores keyed identifiers and delivery status without message content. The server processes the IP address but the plugin does not store it in plain text. The plugin adds no tracking cookies, remote fonts, advertising or analytics. Specify the actual recipients, purposes, legal bases, retention periods and any international transfers applicable to your website; enabling extended privacy does not by itself guarantee GDPR compliance.','If enabled, the email delivery log stores at most 50 events for seven days: time, transport, test or form submission, result and a safe error category. It contains no addresses, subjects, message bodies or credentials. Email is handled by the configured WordPress mail service or SMTP provider. Administrators can disable or clear this log.'=>'If enabled, the email delivery log stores at most 50 events for seven days: time, transport, test or form submission, result and a safe error category. It contains no addresses, subjects, message bodies or credentials. Email is handled by the configured WordPress mail service or SMTP provider. Administrators can disable or clear this log.']];